          "text": "TSOU Jung 鄒容 (T. 威丹), 1885–1905, Apr. 3, anti-Manchu writer, was a native of Pa-hsien (Chungking), Szechwan. His father was a merchant. In 1901 he was sent to Shanghai, and a year later to Japan, to study.",
